    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even that i'm sad, it's just... constant. like this permanent fog. and the more i try to \"fix\" it or \"talk\" about it, the more exhausted i get. it feels like i'm just performing being a person every single day and i'm so sick of the effort. it feels like there's no point in trying to recharge when the battery is just fundamentally broken.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
