      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in a cycle that's never gonna stop. no matter how much \"gentle care\" or whatever i get, the fundamental reality is that i'm just exhausted. it feels like the only thing that would actually bring peace is just... the ability to stop completely. to not have to perform, or wake up, or try anymore. it feels like the only way to get real rest is to just be done with it all.",
